:: Eden Handbook
<<edenSetup>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "eden_home">><<effects>>
<<if $eden.facility.owned>>
	<p>你将孩子们成年后的去向记在这里，整理出他们选择这些道路所需的条件。</p>
	<<set _edenTownEndings to window.EdenHandbook.entries($eden, "town")>>
	<<set _edenAwayEndings to window.EdenHandbook.entries($eden, "away")>>
	<p><span class="gold">镇内</span></p>
	<<if _edenTownEndings.length>>
		<p class="eden-child-meta">按以下顺序判定优先级。</p>
		<ol>
			<<for _edenEnding range _edenTownEndings>>
				<li><span class="gold"><<= _edenEnding.label>>：</span><<= _edenEnding.requirement>></li>
			<</for>>
		</ol>
	<<else>>
		<p class="grey">尚未记录镇内去向。</p>
	<</if>>
	<p><span class="gold">镇外</span></p>
	<<if _edenAwayEndings.length>>
		<p>大学判定：<<= window.EdenHandbook.universityRequirement()>></p>
		<ol>
			<<for _edenEnding range _edenAwayEndings>>
				<li><span class="gold"><<= _edenEnding.label>>：</span><<= _edenEnding.requirement>></li>
			<</for>>
		</ol>
	<<else>>
		<p class="grey">尚未记录镇外去向。</p>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<p>你还没有买下伊甸园。</p>
<</if>>
<<link [[返回伊甸园|Eden Home]]>><</link>>
